@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = REEMPLAZAR_POR_JWT_DEL_LOGIN

### Iniciar sesión. Copiar el token de la respuesta.
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@sirav.local","password":"SiravDemo2026!"}

### Catálogo filtrado. Usar fechas actuales.
GET {{base}}/vehicles?from=2026-11-10&to=2026-11-12&available=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear reserva: sustituir IDs y fechas por datos válidos.
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 55ff4fb9-bd66-4d63-9702-30770724ea03

{"idCliente":1,"idVehiculo":1,"fechaInicio":"2026-11-10","fechaFin":"2026-11-12"}

### Historial
GET {{base}}/reservations/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### MongoDB: consulta compleja de daños altos
GET {{base}}/inspections?severe=true&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tres agregaciones documentales
GET {{base}}/inspections/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reporte complejo
GET {{base}}/reports/ranking?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
